{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひめちゃんと\nCDでーたさんの撮影と取材でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなことや～こんなことについて話しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前に比べて\n2人の置かれてる環境は変わっても\nいつもひめちゃんが近くにいることが\n嬉しく思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏、もっと仲良くなろうね♡だいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/25/8130619/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/25/8130619/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめひな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/25/8130619/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ね、久しぶりに\nサンエトちゃんの5人でメールしたんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近々ご飯行きましょう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いざ！作戦会議じゃーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！ほら！\nつるとんたん！行ってないじゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！つるとんたんで決まり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つるとんたん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/25/8130619/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事のあと\n次のお仕事までの空き時間で\n伊織と映画に行ったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オオカミ少女と黒王子を観にいきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織と映画観るのはまりそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、お互い意見を正直にいい合えるから\nなかなか面白いんだよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大抵くい違うけどね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合わないの！意見！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのに一緒にいて楽しいし楽なの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意見を合わせようっていう\n気を遣わないで済むしね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに、違う考え方の意見をきくと\nなるほど～って思うし\n伊織は私にとって刺激的～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スパイス！！！だいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織スパイス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、伊織を待ってる間\n買い物したんだ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、ブレスレットやイヤリングにはまってます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１つブレスレット買ったの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度握手会でつけるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/25/8130619/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/25/8130619/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type"